/Alt (Matrix of the four archetypes against the four connectivity profiles. Self-Contained Workloads often use No Hub and other profiles where justified; Selectively Connected Workloads can use No Hub where approved local peering or Azure service endpoints suffice, or Remote Hub, Minimal Hub, or Full Hub; Hybrid-Dependent Workloads use Remote Hub, Minimal Hub, or Full Hub; interdependent groups can use No Hub for approved same-region connectivity, Remote Hub where acceptable, and Minimal Hub or Full Hub when justified.)
